<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>科研评价 on 如是有为</title><link>https://sensor.fans/tags/%E7%A7%91%E7%A0%94%E8%AF%84%E4%BB%B7/</link><description>Recent content in 科研评价 on 如是有为</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sensor.fans/tags/%E7%A7%91%E7%A0%94%E8%AF%84%E4%BB%B7/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>科技部长罕见发文直指科研圈子文化</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/46sypzddxtph1vfdjxjpjg/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/46sypzddxtph1vfdjxjpjg/</guid><description>&lt;p>几天前，《求是》杂志刊发了科技部党组书记、部长阴和俊的署名文章《以更大力度更实举措加强基础研究》。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/0c1a9bb325fc1f862e363a3697fb6884.png" alt="《求是》2026年第18期封面" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>这不算一则“新闻”，却很快在科研圈里被反复转发。原因不在文章本身有多长，而在它罕见地点破了几个平时少有人公开提的问题。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>